@Override
public void toXML(Document doc, Element parent) {
    if (apiResponse == null) {
        parent.appendChild(
                doc.createTextNode(
                        getValue() != null
                                ? XMLStringUtil.escapeControlChrs(this.getValue())
                                : ""));
    } else {
        apiResponse.toXML(doc, parent);
    }
}
```

**How it works:** When no nested response exists, it appends a text node to the parent element, escaping control characters via `XMLStringUtil.escapeControlChrs`, or an empty string if the value is null. When a nested response exists, it delegates rendering to that response.

